🚀 Deployment

The project is being prepared for interactive deployment using Streamlit.

The deployed application will load the trained model and allow users to explore bankruptcy-risk predictions using financial indicators.

The deployment workflow is designed to use the validated saved model rather than retraining the model inside the application.

📌 Reproducibility

The project includes a requirements.txt file specifying the main Python dependencies used for the analysis.

A fixed random seed was used in the modelling workflow where applicable to support reproducibility.

